 "remarks": "Prepared to be wowed when you step into 136 Alton Rd. You will be greeted by the new state-of-the-art kitchen with quartz countertops, fabulous island and all high end appliances. This 3 bedroom 2 1/2 bath home boasts all newly finished hardwood floors, built in surround sound throughout and recessed lighting on the first floor. There is a new roof, gutters and insulation in both the basement & attic. The professionally landscaped yard will not disappoint with the beautiful perennials & shrubs. The rooms are all generously sized and flooded with light! Just minutes to downtown Stamford, Metro North, houses of worship and all that vibrant Stamford has to offer!",
